*.pyc

# Rendered demo audio. Reproducible with tools/render_samples.py, and the full
# set runs to 35 MB; only the two short default-settings clips are committed so
# the repository stays small but still lets someone hear the voices.
samples/*
!samples/textalker_default.wav
!samples/textalker_v13_default.wav

# The BestSpeech wrapper this project's COM layer was adapted from. Kept
